WEBVTT

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.370
Life with an Ordinary Guy who Reincarnated into a

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.370
Total Fantasy Knockout

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:32.820
Y...

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:34.570
You little jerk!

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:37.570
Oh, Premier. It's been 
a while. You been well?

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:39.450
Does it look like I'm doing well?!

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:41.880
Do you have any idea how much 
I've looked for you two?

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.480
I don't remember how many 
times I nearly died!

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:46.790
Well, well... I'm glad you're safe.

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:48.540
You're the one person 
I'm definitely gonna kill!

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:52.280
And this is the perfect opportunity 
to exact revenge for my honor.

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:56.520
Last time, you used a curse or something 
to brainwash the villagers, but...

00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:00.680
no matter how you look at it,
 this man clearly prefers me.

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:02.810
So now we're even.

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:04.320
Marry me.

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:05.560
This again?

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:08.450
I'd cast aside my village if it were for you.

00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:11.320
And I am prepared to leave my 
wife and run away to the city.

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:14.130
I have two children, 
but I want another three.

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:16.440
Normally, you'd just call 
a guy like this a dirtbag.

00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:19.300
It seems you acknowledge her beauty.

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:23.820
No! I spent a large sum of 
money to obtain this elf.

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:26.080
I can't give up on her so easily...

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:30.010
I admit defeat.

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:30.830
Okay!

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:33.340
Don't give up so easily!

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:34.480
It's too soon!

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:38.720
My worth cannot be determined 
within a tiny two-person group!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:40.850
I challenge you, woman!

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:43.180
Majority rules! 
We'll decide this with a vote!

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:44.280
This again?

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:47.600
I mean, if you win, you'll be sacrificed. 
Are you okay with that?

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:52.270
I heard that the fishing here 
had been poor for some time.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:57.030
Then, thanks to the sudden appearance of 
a giant squid, the catch became plentiful.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:02.030
But they say that it asked for a 
living sacrifice as compensation.

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:05.030
And that it said something like...

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:07.850
Someone who appears snappy
 and slightly impertinent,

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:10.280
whose chest is on the small side,

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:12.420
and who looks shallow at first glance,

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:17.260
but when she's made to succumb, she glares 
at you. Please find that kind of young lady.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:20.050
It's tossed some pretty particular 
preferences together.

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:22.300
Right. Let's kill it.

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:26.810
It has said that if it's killed, they'll 
once again be unable to catch squid.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:30.320
So it can use its intelligence. 
How interminably irritating.

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:35.350
But why, when they have an elf, 
did they kidnap my companion?

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:37.720
Because of a power struggle.

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:42.820
Whoever finds a suitable beauty 
will become the next village head.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.400
That's ridiculous.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:47.830
But if that's the case, both of 
them do fit the requirements.

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:52.770
Still, I don't think it's possible 
to beat an elf in terms of looks.

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:55.400
No. There's no doubt that she will.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:58.870
Is your companion that beautiful?

00:03:58.870 --> 00:03:59.840
Well...

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:02.250
Even amongst all the beauties I've ever seen,

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:05.590
she's probably far and 
away the most beautiful.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:08.790
Love is blind, after all.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:10.850
We're not in that kind of relationship.

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:14.550
Why do you keep following me?

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:16.620
I feel badly about destroying your cart,

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.730
but I don't have enough 
on hand to compensate you.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:23.300
Oh, that's fine. 
Actually, I'm feeling a little guilty.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:28.240
I thought there was a little more 
romance to this job, you see.

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:34.570
Plus, there's making connections. I'd love 
for you to allow me to accompany you.

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:36.250
If that's the case, then fine.

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:40.750
But if my companion meets with
 any harm, I will not show any mercy.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:43.570
You really are in love, aren't you?

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:45.010
I told you it's not like that.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:48.600
In that case, let's hurry up and find her.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:49.900
Huh? Hey!

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:54.520
You never know. She might be in 
a deserted warehouse like this.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:00.150
Huh?

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:01.820
Oh.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:08.160
Episode 7.

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:08.160
A Guy Who Reincarnated as a Fantasy                                .
Knockout and a Squid Fire                                                 .

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.200
Aren't you going to eat?

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.390
<i>I suppose it's fine.</i>

00:05:20.030 --> 00:05:22.890
Still, is this the time to be 
eating a leisurely meal?

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:26.090
Now, now. We should eat when we can.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:29.600
A meal is the best way for 
us to get to know each other.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:30.300
Right?

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:33.370
I have no intention of 
being friendly with humans.

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:37.290
Especially not with you two. 
You're making this precious squid taste bad.

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:40.060
I want you to die.

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:43.140
Die.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:45.320
Die, you idiot.

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:49.390
To be eaten with such enjoyment... 
I'm sure the squid must be satisfied, too.

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:48.450
Idiot.

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:50.070
Die!

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:53.240
Why are you two together anyway?

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:54.580
Were you a team?

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.580
The course of events made it unavoidable.

00:05:57.930 --> 00:06:00.700
Setting that aside, there is 
something I want to ask you.

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:02.710
It must be about that woman, right?

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:07.340
I was just with her. 
At this rate, she'll be killed tonight.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.830
Do you know where she is?

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:12.260
Well, I wonder...

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:13.600
Tell me.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:16.600
N-Now, calm down.

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:20.850
This squid's yummy.

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:22.920
Is this the time to be enjoying eating that?

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:25.550
Hey, are you listening, Premier?

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:27.440
<i>It's been so long since I've had a hot meal.</i>

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:30.020
<i>I didn't realize it warmed 
the heart this much.</i>

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:33.160
<i>Ever since I was beaten by these guys,</i>

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:35.980
<i>I've been capture by weird people,</i>

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:38.930
<i>gotten lost even though 
I was following the map,</i>

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:43.550
<i>treated like a thief, and turned into a 
slave or a sacrifice before I knew it...</i>

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:43.740
You win!

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:45.110
<i>And on top of that...</i>

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:47.550
Hey, Four-Eyes.

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:52.550
Form a truce with me.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:53.930
What?

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:55.730
I will help you.

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:58.560
And in exchange, you will help me.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:04.540
Have you heard? The humans of this 
village revere that squid as a god.

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:09.630
If you kill that god 
right in front of them...

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:12.720
what will happen to those villagers?

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:18.040
Killing that squid will wreck 
the festival and this village.

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:20.810
Interesting. That's a nice expression.

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:24.290
I think that interfering with 
the festival is a good idea,

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:29.170
but with a monster of that size, 
defeating it ourselves will be impossible.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:31.180
Let's kill the squid.

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:33.180
Weren't you listening to me?

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:37.260
I was thinking that if I had the 
opportunity, I wanted to kill it.

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:38.680
Shall we?

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:42.140
On top of being smart, it lives underwater!

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:44.760
Even if you say we're 
going to do this, how...

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:47.400
Calm yourself, trader.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:50.400
Don't worry. Leave it to me.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:54.410
<i>Leave it to me. Leave it 
to me. Leave it to me.</i>

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:58.160
Hmm. It seems you have some sort 
of plan, don't you, Four-Eyes?

00:07:58.480 --> 00:08:01.410
Yes. But you should prepare 
yourself, Premier.

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:05.770
In order to kill that squid, 
your assistance will be required.

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:08.210
Can you promise that you won't 
run away when it comes time?

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:11.220
<i>This man...</i>

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:16.800
<i>He's a troublesome enemy, but when 
he's an ally, he's this reliable?</i>

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:20.720
<i>Strong. Smart. As well as cool-headed.</i>

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:23.730
<i>And when I look more closely, he's handsome.</i>

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:26.560
I promise.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:31.230
I swear it by my goddess.
I will lend you my strength!

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:38.270
Hey. Why do I have ropes tied around me?

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:40.410
And what are these round things?

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:41.500
Floats.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.370
Floats?

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:46.250
We're fishing for squid and you're the bait.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:53.170
Do your best not to drown!

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:55.970
You four-eyed weasel!

00:08:58.400 --> 00:09:01.710
See if I ever trust a human again!

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:04.270
An ordinary person would never 
think of something like that.

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.270
I'd expect no less from you.

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:08.440
Really, who are you?

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:11.530
A regular human wouldn't be 
able to throw her that far.

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:15.400
Well, I'd intended to throw 
her a little farther, but...

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:17.160
Huh?

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:19.470
<i>This is a little odd.</i>

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:22.410
Oh, then your shoulders aren't at their best?

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:26.060
If you wouldn't mind it being me, 
I could loosen your body up for you.

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:28.420
N-No, I won't impose.

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:31.450
Really? That's too bad.

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:35.170
You're suddenly standing very close.

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:38.430
Would you like some shredded dried squid?

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.550
Oh, I see you have both hands full.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:44.240
In that case, please open 
your mouth. Here, say "ahhh."

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:49.560
There's no one left to interfere. 
It's just the two of us now.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:51.280
<i>Wait for me, Tachibana.</i>

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:53.820
<i>I will kill the squid and find you!</i>

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.770
I can't swim!

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:59.820
Don't worry! You've got floats!

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:00.890
Yay!

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:02.830
<b><i>Three hours later...</i></b>

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:02.830
It's so high!

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:05.640
It's still got flavor to it, this squid.

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:08.830
They do say that you can keep 
chewing it for a lifetime.

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:12.840
That aside, we've caught 
nothing. Nothing at all.

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.060
Is the bait no good?

00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:18.340
And is the bait person still alive?

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:20.050
I haven't seen any movement in—

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:21.460
Hey! Are you fishing for squid?

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:22.150
Yes.

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:23.530
How stupid!

00:10:23.530 --> 00:10:25.220
Of course you can't catch any!

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:26.830
Squid are nocturnal!

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:32.560
<i>...nocturnal! ...nocturnal! ...nocturnal!</i>

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:36.070
I'm exhausted.

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:38.540
But I must endure.

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:40.700
Once we've killed the squid...

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:44.700
This time... This time for 
sure, I'll get them and...

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:46.200
Huh?

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:48.270
Huh?

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:53.740
Huh? Is that...

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:58.550
We've got a bite!

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:01.780
You guys, hurry up and save me!

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:03.680
Uh.

00:11:08.380 --> 00:11:13.520
I received this precious nut from the premier. 
Though I've treasured it, it dried up and now...

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:14.960
Really, you should've eaten it.

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:16.070
Is she bullying you or something?

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:19.990
Something may have happened to the premier.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:22.870
Your expression isn't saying 
that you hope for her safety.

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.420
I find you pretty scary.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:30.960
Life with an Ordinary Guy who Reincarnated into a Total Fantasy Knockout

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:30.960
Squid Village's Specialty, Shredded Dried Squid

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:30.960
You can't chew through the legs, 
so you can chew them for a lifetime.

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:30.960
You can't chew through the legs, 
so you can chew them for a lifetime!

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:36.450
The way the sunset reflects off 
the lake is so beautiful.

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:38.900
Now then, it's time to get ready.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:42.490
<i>It's already time for the sacrifice?! 
Wait, wait, wait!</i>

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:44.880
<i>I haven't finished emotionally 
preparing myself!</i>

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:47.580
<i>No, but it's only a giant 
squid I'm up against.</i>

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:46.430
<b>Eaten</b>

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:47.930
<b>Crushed 
to Death</b>

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:51.230
<i>If I put up a serious fight, 
I might have a chance...</i>

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:49.470
<b>Suffocation</b>

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:54.860
No, I won't! I have no chance!

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:56.730
That giant squid is freakin' scary!

00:11:57.060 --> 00:12:00.740
<i>I don't wanna die. I especially 
don't wanna get eaten!</i>

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.850
<i>Squid! I'm begging you!</i>

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:06.740
<i>I eat you, but please don't eat me!</i>

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:10.000
I'm not talking to you for a while.

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:13.500
<i>Why did we pick this time to have a fight?</i>

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:17.250
<i>This happened once before a long time ago.</i>

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:20.720
Please, save me, Jinguuji!

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:25.510
I can't understand what the teacher 
is saying, so I can't keep up in class!

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:28.760
You take too many naps during 
class. This is your own fault.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:31.360
My part-time job's been super busy.

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:32.010
Why should I care?

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:34.270
If my scores are in the red 
next time, it'll be really bad!

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:36.770
My summer vacation will disappear!

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.270
You...

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:40.240
Are things really that bad?

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:42.220
They're super bad.

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:44.650
<b>Seizariya</b>

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:44.650
I'm telling you...

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:47.480
explain in a way so that 
even I can understand!

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:50.040
Why is the one teaching 
getting the blame here?

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.850
Man, I just don't get it!

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:54.530
How can you not understand?

00:12:54.530 --> 00:12:56.290
I'm the one explaining it to you.

00:12:56.570 --> 00:12:58.060
Focus properly.

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:01.170
Don't play innocent about 
your mind's capabilities.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:04.080
Come on. I'll explain it again.

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.300
I'm just not smart.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:11.310
How can you understand how someone 
who can't do things feels?

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:16.810
Tachibana!

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:19.310
Idiot! Stupid, useless eggplant! Useless!

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:22.560
Don't ever speak to me again, 
you useless eggplant!

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:23.720
U-Useless eggplant...

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:25.070
<i>And so...</i>

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:31.140
<i>the man known as Jinguuji really 
didn't speak to him for about a week.</i>

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:36.080
<i>In the end, I failed. With all the extra 
lessons and tests, my summer vanished.</i>

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:40.360
<i>Blast it! If I can't count on a rescue, 
then I'll have to make a move myself!</i>

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:42.090
<i>But what should I do?</i>

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:47.930
<i>That's right! I can charm them to cause 
confusion and use that chance to escape!</i>

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.800
<i>In that case, I need to get this thing off!</i>

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:54.810
<i>It won't come off!</i>

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:56.240
Hey, what are you doing!

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:57.810
Stop shaking the cage!

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:01.300
Take that!

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:02.400
<b>Tachibana            .
.                                .
Luck → 83                       .
Unlocking successful!</b>

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:07.800
Hey, you should've locked it properly.

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:09.320
I-I'm sorry!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.280
Hey, what's wrong?

00:14:12.690 --> 00:14:14.300
You listening to me? Hey!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.410
A-A goddess...

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:20.060
Ow...

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:22.590
Huh?

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.590
It's pulling harder than I imagined it would!

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:28.590
You had a plan though, didn't you?

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:31.790
No, it was just thinking 
of a way to fish it out.

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:33.470
That's impossible!

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:37.550
<i>Why? Why is my strength failing?</i>

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:39.630
<i>Has anything been different than usual?</i>

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:43.730
<i>My meals are perfectly balanced. 
And I've been doing my morning routine.</i>

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:45.980
<i>Has there been a sudden, unexpected...</i>

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:48.680
Kill her!

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:50.280
Kill that girl!

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:51.490
Stop, will you?

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.140
Wh-What's all that?

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:54.980
T-Tachibana!

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:57.040
That woman is a witch!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.250
She's a witch who's seduced my husband!

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:01.960
Marry me! I want three children!

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.630
No, I want four!

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:08.240
Wait, wait! This girl is an 
offering to the squid god!

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:09.240
Why...

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:12.720
Why does this have to happen to me?!

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:15.800
Don't try to garner sympathy, 
you filthy woman!

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:19.850
I'm sure you've used that face to 
ensnare gentlemen, haven't you?!

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:22.840
You've never done an honest day of work! 
You don't know how the world works!

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.860
Being beautiful is such a boon, isn't it?

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:27.930
Your very existence is a crime!

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:28.980
That's right!

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:31.470
Right, blast it! I've made up my mind!

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:33.870
I'm not gonna die, no matter what!

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:38.630
The morals of a village that offers 
outsiders up as sacrifices are really low!

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:42.200
This is why I hate spiteful 
country villages, you morons!

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:44.440
She's even starting to badmouth our village!

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:46.380
Those words are the witch's curse!

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:49.860
Could it be that the person at the 
center of that is your companion?

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:50.720
That's right.

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:53.470
It's not as if I'm like 
this because I want to be!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:56.660
Labeling people because of their 
appearance or your personal opinions...

00:15:56.660 --> 00:16:00.850
Laughing and pointing, deciding where 
everyone stands... Is that fun?!

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.570
Don't shift the responsibility here!

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:04.400
Do something about this yourselves!

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.450
What's with this "sacrifice" thing?

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:08.610
Make a clay figure in the shape of 
a beautiful woman and give it that!

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:11.470
She's saying some crazy things.

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:12.260
Yes.

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:14.860
She's a very honest person.

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:19.120
Tachibana! Are you safe?!

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:20.500
Jinguuji?!

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:22.750
As you can see, I'm about to die!

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:24.500
I'll rescue you now!

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:27.000
My arms are at their limit...

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:29.320
I'm begging you, Jinguuji!

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:32.510
Do something about these villagers!

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:33.510
I will!

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:52.610
Take that!

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:00.820
The bait person!

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:05.620
Is this really all right? 
Isn't the elf inside that thing?

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:09.320
I have confidence in the premier.

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:13.130
When trusting goes too far, it sounds a lot like abandoning responsibility!

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.880
O Lord Squid God!

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:18.110
Why?!

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:21.140
I was just about to suck on a cute girl,

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.840
and then all of a sudden this happened!

00:17:23.840 --> 00:17:26.520
Where did those preferences 
of yours come from anyway?!

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:31.910
Oh. There is a cute girl here, too.

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:33.650
This guy can still move?

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:34.990
So cute!

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:40.830
I wanna eat her up!

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:47.890
Tachibana!

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:49.170
Hold on just a little longer!

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.170
You can say that, but...

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:54.550
Huh?

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:56.510
Is this a horror story?

00:17:56.820 --> 00:18:00.510
Now that it's come to this, I'm taking 
you with me! Die beside me!

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:01.960
Stop!

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:04.090
Stop! Stop, Premier!

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:07.350
We're just about to kill this squid!

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:08.520
What did you say?

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.650
Premier! Use this!

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:14.230
<i>This is...</i>

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:26.530
Th—

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.180
That was so cool!

00:18:32.180 --> 00:18:32.870
Hmph.

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:39.930
The edge on that Damascus 
knife really is good!

00:18:40.400 --> 00:18:41.470
Ow!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:44.180
Th-Thanks...

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:45.500
Premier?

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:55.280
This is hot! Really hot!

00:18:57.640 --> 00:18:59.220
It's grilled squid!

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:03.740
Yum!

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:06.240
What are you staring at?

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:09.160
If you want some, how about you 
grill it and eat it yourselves?

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:12.130
Oh. It is our god, after all, so...

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:14.920
What kind of god is this delicious?!

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:17.880
This thing's just a giant squid! A squid!

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:20.560
Just a giant squid...

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:24.970
Hidary...

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:26.090
Miggy...

00:19:26.090 --> 00:19:27.770
We've been beaten.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:32.440
I want to ask you all!

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:36.610
Is it right to sacrifice a person's 
life to a squid monster?!

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:41.290
We cannot continue squids way! We need a 
breath of fresh air, do we not, squids?

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:42.530
Yeah!

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:44.470
I'm getting tired of all the squid quips.

00:19:44.470 --> 00:19:45.030
Yes.

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:49.040
And by a unanimous vote,
 she will be our next village head!

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:50.470
Huh?

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:53.830
Oh. My level went up.

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:58.170
How about it, young man? Want one 
of these, too? They're delicious!

00:19:56.610 --> 00:19:59.440
Th-They really adapt quickly.

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:01.000
Are they okay with this?

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:02.680
They seem to be having fun,

00:20:02.990 --> 00:20:04.290
so I think it's fine, don't you?

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:08.370
Hey, Tachibana.

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:09.180
Huh?

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:11.560
I'm sorry.

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:13.160
About what?

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:14.850
Your composition book.

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:18.060
I'd forgotten! Yeah, that happened!

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:20.610
But I'm not angry anymore.

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:24.520
To think you have stuff in your past 
you don't want people digging into...

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:26.920
I guess you are sort of human after all.

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:28.080
Sort of?

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:31.640
I mean, the part that's been scribbled 
over in marker won't come back,

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:34.830
so let's talk about this again once 
we've gotten back to our world.

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:38.500
When that happens, show me
 your composition book, okay?

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:41.090
Sorry. I don't have mine anymore.

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:43.780
My grandmother threw it out.

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:46.590
Oh...

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:49.780
I see. I guess there's no helping it, then.

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:51.850
Yes. Nothing to be done.

00:20:55.550 --> 00:20:58.690
Don't leave me again. It's dangerous.

00:20:59.140 --> 00:21:02.560
No, you don't take your 
eyes off of me. I'll die.

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:03.960
That's true.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:06.950
Was that a marriage proposal?

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:09.600
Village head!

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:10.460
I am not!

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:11.490
Village head!

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:12.270
You've got this wrong!

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:15.440
Won't you please lead us squids?!

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:16.260
Cut it out already!

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:18.710
Who's this guy?

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:23.000
Oh, dear. It's been eaten.

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:26.220
The delicious smell is 
wafting all the way up here.

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:28.640
I want to eat some, too.

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:30.720
Make do with that dried squid.

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:35.870
Still, as soon as they showed up, 
I did think that we would fail,

00:21:35.870 --> 00:21:37.730
but I didn't think it would end like this.

00:21:40.050 --> 00:21:42.280
That guy with the glasses is strong, right?

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:44.760
After all, he is the man who defeated me.

00:21:44.760 --> 00:21:46.990
Why are you bragging about that?

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:50.770
We have no further business 
here, so we're leaving.

00:21:50.770 --> 00:21:51.990
Understood.

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:55.000
We can give this squid to the 
Demon Lord as a souvenir.

00:21:55.680 --> 00:21:59.630
When they're separated, 
his strength declines?

00:22:01.600 --> 00:22:03.740
I have a good idea.

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:08.680
<b>with</b>

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:37.640
Hey, why did you do all that anyway?

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:39.970
I just wanted to suck on 
a cute girl, that's all.

00:23:39.970 --> 00:23:43.320
And because of that selfish desire of yours, 
you ended up getting punished, right?

00:23:43.320 --> 00:23:44.080
Yes...

00:23:43.730 --> 00:23:49.940
<b>Episode 8 

00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:45.300
Have you reflected on your mistakes?

00:23:45.300 --> 00:23:45.760
Yes.

00:23:45.760 --> 00:23:47.610
Oh, there was still some squid left?

00:23:46.480 --> 00:23:48.290
Wait, Premier!

00:23:48.290 --> 00:23:49.940
Man, that's yummy.
